{
  "_comment": "Picker taps for lnx-server (1920x1080): dead-zone button opens the view grid, tiles reroute the view. Copy to touch.json on the host and edit only device/endpoint: confirm device with `python3 touch.py --list-devices`. Tile rects are generated -- never hand-edit them; recompute with: python3 renderers/picker.py --width <W> --height <H> --views <csv> (paste FIRST under \"regions\": earlier entries win overlaps). No fullscreen reload_confirm region by design: it would swallow the tap-anywhere fallback, and dismissal-first ordering makes a same-tap confirm miss anyway (see TOUCH.md). Validate with `python3 touch.py --config touch.json --check-views` before restarting displayd-touch. Revert: restore the backup (see TOUCH.md).",
